{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01F2EsPkfPPxZh1x9HEmwRR6","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"população de Portugal 2026 INE estimativa\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"os especialistas do denominador quando portugal descobre oficialmente que ja era mais pobre\",\"url\":\"https://fgoncalves.codeberg.page/fragmentoscaos/pdf/2026/06/os-especialistas-do-denominador-quando-portugal-descobre-oficialmente-que-ja-era-mais-pobre.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"População de Portugal (AO VIVO)\",\"url\":\"https://www.worldometers.info/pt/populacao-mundial/portugal-populacao/\"},{\"title\":\"Residem em Portugal 11,4 milhões de pessoas: 1,6 milhões são estrangeiras\",\"url\":\"https://www.idealista.pt/news/node/76151\"},{\"title\":\"Portugal terá menos dois milhões de pessoas daqui a 60 anos\",\"url\":\"https://rr.pt/noticia/pais/2020/03/31/portugal-tera-menos-dois-milhoes-de-pessoas-daqui-a-60-anos/187450/\"},{\"title\":\"economiafinancas.com\",\"url\":\"https://economiafinancas.com/2026/06/22/\"},{\"title\":\"Revista Eletrónica do INE - julho de 2026\",\"url\":\"https://www.ine.pt/ine_novidades/semin/INEWS66/index.html\"},{\"title\":\"Revista Eletrónica do INE - julho de 2026\",\"url\":\"https://www.ine.pt/ine_novidades/semin/INEWS66/\"},{\"title\":\"População residente em Portugal ultrapassou 10,6 milhões, mas \\\"envelhecimento continua a acentuar-se\\\"\",\"url\":\"https://rr.pt/noticia/pais/2024/06/18/populacao-residente-em-portugal-ultrapassou-106-milhoes/382853/\"},{\"title\":\"Portugal Population (LIVE)\",\"url\":\"https://www.worldometers.info/world-population/portugal-population/\"}]\n\nThe search didn't turn up an INE estimate for 2026 itself. The most recent official figure is for the end of 2025, and it is much higher than earlier numbers.\n\n- **INE's end-2025 estimate:** The INE reports that the resident population reached 11,424,031 people at the end of 2025 in Portugal. This was published on 22 June 2026.\n- **Foreign residents:** About 1.6 million residents are foreign nationals, or 14.0% of the total.\n- **Revisions:** INE revised its earlier figures, so the 2024 population is now updated to 11,387,222, compared with the 10,749,635 previously published. INE also said that between 2021 and 2025 the resident population grew by 824,914 people, with migration flows in 2022 to 2024 being exceptionally high.\n- **Ageing:** In 2025, the ageing index reached 19 older people for every 10 young people, up from 18 in 2021.\n\n**Conflicting figure:** Worldometer, which relies on UN World Population Prospects data, gives a much lower figure. It shows an estimated 10,395,362 people at mid-year 2026. The gap is roughly one million people, and it appears to come from INE's large migration-driven revision, which the UN series does not reflect. For official figures, INE's June 2026 release is the authoritative source. I did not find a separate INE projection for 2026 itself.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","uuid":"9361451a-b8df-4826-949d-3a7c353eb12e","timestamp":"2026-10-15T02:26:22.926Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"população de Portugal 2026 INE estimativa","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01EHaVhFkLarSmo4Uu1KfzJo","content":[{"title":"os especialistas do denominador quando portugal descobre oficialmente que ja era mais pobre","url":"https://fgoncalves.codeberg.page/fragmentoscaos/pdf/2026/06/os-especialistas-do-denominador-quando-portugal-descobre-oficialmente-que-ja-era-mais-pobre.pdf"},{"title":"População de Portugal (AO VIVO)","url":"https://www.worldometers.info/pt/populacao-mundial/portugal-populacao/"},{"title":"Residem em Portugal 11,4 milhões de pessoas: 1,6 milhões são estrangeiras","url":"https://www.idealista.pt/news/node/76151"},{"title":"Portugal terá menos dois milhões de pessoas daqui a 60 anos","url":"https://rr.